This verification layer handles routing active mouse positions, multi-touch events, and keyboard macros inside the desktop server context. When interacting with the 3D Desktop Cube, events must correctly transition between your parent system and isolated terminal sandboxes (Alpine, Arch, and Termux environments) without socket conflicts or visual disconnects




